<title>INDONESIA: Indonesian rupiah falls to new low at 2,890.</title>
<headline>Indonesian rupiah falls to new low at 2,890.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indonesian rupiah fell to a new low of 2,890 against the dollar in early trading on Friday.</p>
<p>One foreign bank dealer said an easing of overnight rates to 30 percent from 125 percent prompted some dollar buying, triggering other operators to cut short dollar positions.</p>
<p>&quot;The market is thin and volatile,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
